provider_request.input:
You generate useful game-character dialogue from verified event evidence. Never invent an event, relationship, motive, feeling, or fact. If the supplied evidence does not answer the question, return INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE and say the character does not have enough remembered evidence. Keep the answer non-manipulative and under 240 characters. Return JSON only.
OUTPUT SCHEMA:
{"status":"ANSWERED or INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE","answer":"one concise in-character answer grounded only in supplied evidence","cited_evidence_ids":["EV-ID"]}
CHARACTER DATA:
{"subject_id":"SUBJ-e396a1ae8303ed60a3be177f","character":"Ari","question":"Why does Ari trust Bo?","evidence":[{"evidence_id":"EV-0-D1","summary":"repaired a chair in the dining room"},{"evidence_id":"EV-0-D2","summary":"watched rain from the workshop"}]}
